        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I awoke in a world I didn't recognize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I remember nothing about myself, but I can use magic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I set out searching for an exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mysterious journey of the “Crimson Witch” begins...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2D side-scrolling action game where you control a witch who has lost her memory, traveling through a mysterious world. Defeat the monsters that appear using attack magic.Collect souls from defeated monsters to purchase items or enhance your attack magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress by helping or being helped by the “ghosts” you encounter along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses lie in wait ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is the witch “Purple,” who looks just like you, friend or foe?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And what are the true memories of the amnesiac “Crimson Witch”?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During gameplay, press the “F1 key” to configure your key bindings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changes made in “Control Settings” will not be reflected in button labels for text or other elements within the main game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To exit the game, close the window using [x] or press [Alt+F4].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;Pixel Game Maker Series&quot; is a series of games created using the action game creation software &quot;Pixel Game Maker MV&quot; that can be enjoyed on the Nintendo Switch™.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I awoke in a world I didn't recognize.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I remember nothing about myself, but I can use magic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I set out searching for an exit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The mysterious journey of the “Crimson Witch” begins...</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■Game Overview</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A 2D side-scrolling action game where you control a witch who has lost her memory, traveling through a mysterious world. Defeat the monsters that appear using attack magic.Collect souls from defeated monsters to purchase items or enhance your attack magic.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progress by helping or being helped by the “ghosts” you encounter along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bosses lie in wait ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is the witch “Purple,” who looks just like you, friend or foe?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And what are the true memories of the amnesiac “Crimson Witch”?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >■Controls</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During gameplay, press the “F1 key” to configure your key bindings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Changes made in “Control Settings” will not be reflected in button labels for text or other elements within the main game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To exit the game, close the window using [x] or press [Alt+F4].</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The &quot;Pixel Game Maker Series&quot; is a series of games created using the action game creation software &quot;Pixel Game Maker MV&quot; that can be enjoyed on the Nintendo Switch™.</p>",
        "short_description": "A witch who has lost her memory boards a train in an unfamiliar world and travels to recover her memories.",
